  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>as</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>for</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, function is&nbsp;discontinuous at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the function is continuous at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>"
